Hi,

I'm doing some copy number analysis and I've gone through all of the
standard procedures. Now I'd like to look at the chip effects
(estimates from the fitted RMA model) for SNPs in a linkage region
(i.e. a particular segment of a given chromsome). I'm unsure how to do
this. Any suggestions?

Thanks,

Jeremy

